 "text": "Chinese rescuers are searching for some 30 people after a landslide in southwestern Sichuan province buried 10 houses. The Ministry of Emergency Management deployed hundreds of rescuers, including firefighters, following the landslide Saturday in the Junlian county. State broadcaster CCTV said two people were pulled out alive and about 200 others evacuated.",
